her; players guess the movie. Includes a reverse version where a movie is given and the player guesses which actor was not in it.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Clues and Answer Reveal",\n      "description": "Each quiz provides clues and an option to reveal the answer, then moves to the next question.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Results Summary",\n      "description": "At the end of each game, users see their results and performance summary.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "Angular"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#fc03c6",\n    "secondary": "#ffffff",\n    "accent": "#10100e"\n  },\n  "theme": "light",\n  "layoutDescription": "After login, users see a dashboard with all quiz game types as cards. Selecting a game opens a dedicated quiz interface with progress indicators, question area, clues, answer input, reveal button, and navigation. Results are shown at the end. The UI is vibrant, with Kollywood-inspired visuals and clear, interactive elements."\n}'}",
